Hello!

There are couple of Adaptec U320 controllers, that were not supported in the 
2.4.20 kernel. And i believe not yet supported in 2.4.21-pre5

I am sending you the whole directory with aacraid drivers, which i produced 
the following way:

I used redhat's kernel source (2.4.18-3) and patched it with manufacturer's 
drivers.
( for some reason Adaptec does patches for RedHat and other distributions 
instead of submitting patches to you guys)

After that i copied this driver attached to 2.4.20 kernel tree and it appeared 
to work beautifully with the raid controller. 
So i hope it may be helpful to somebody just to compile kernel source instead 
of having hassles that i had to make it work.

Will be happy to hear from you.
  
